  description: +10 (Max 12) evasion rating, and you can evade skill damage too (Elemental
    Strike, Dexterity Drive, Life Sap...), not only normal attacks. Every time you
    evade, you strike back at once for 40% (Max 48%) of a normal attack. The counter
    can't be countered and gives no Mana.
